{"completed": true, "response": "<WritingBlock id=\"58321\" variant=\"standard\">熟悉的歌声再次浮现，开口的一瞬仍带着原先的温柔，却不再像先前那样把情绪轻轻收住。旋律舒展开来，呼吸变得宽阔，每一次起伏都仿佛有了更深的回响。低处的声音沉沉荡开，如钟鸣般厚重而悠远；高处则灿烂得近乎耀眼，明亮的音色一层层闪耀。两端相隔如此遥远，听来却并不空旷，反而让歌声显得格外丰盈。那份熟悉的柔情里，如今多了难以掩饰的热度，既有激动，也有深深的眷恋。声音越发饱满，情绪几乎要漫溢出来，却始终保留着歌唱的柔软与从容。仿佛那些曾经欲言又止的感受，此刻终于能够毫无拘束地流淌。</WritingBlock>", "metadata": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "headless": true, "provider_interface": true, "no_auto_retry": true, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\yi-cookie-repair-20261006\\job-2f2c7825f7cc4b94828dd716b8b63709", "response_sha256": "c0dbb561cdc8f7a21252da931ba5e45d41eb7f6b85c53cc3584dbfebf70ed45e", "session_handle": "85171bbd-93e7-49f5-af83-9ce074b9e13c", "attachments": [], "prompt_normalization": "single_leading_BOM_removed_CRLF_or_CR_to_LF_and_trim_end", "pre_submit_scope": null, "initialization": {"source": "native_pre_send_aborted_handoff", "browser_assisted_initialization": true, "native_browser_generation_sent": false, "http_version": "auto", "nonpersonalization_inherited": false, "handoff_age_seconds": 0.893, "state": "claimed"}, "headless_initializer": {"headless": true, "native_browser_generation_sent": false, "completed": true, "browser_version": {"type": "string", "length": 13, "sha256": "9722c94be680575b307b26183e1a423460d4568949ad7f3e7f985d33d9bf0e26"}, "sealed_handoff_written": true, "browser_closed": true, "cloned_private_profile_removed": true, "elapsed_seconds": 6.755}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "continuation_expected": false, "handoff_seen": false, "lifecycle_updates": 145, "first_assistant_seconds": 9.438, "first_text_seconds": 18.938, "stream_seconds": 27.016, "channel_update_counts": {"final": 135}, "bounded_server_observations": {"scope": "http_sse", "tool_message_observation_count": 0, "truncated": false, "scalar_patch_tool_role_inheritance": false, "message_finished_successfully_is_tool_success": false, "tool_result_observati